# Read-only preparation of a previously previewed navigation candidate.
#
# This request must not send a navigation goal or publish /cmd_vel.
# The provider will revalidate:
# - distance from the latest AMCL pose
# - target and surrounding global-costmap cells
# - /move_base/make_plan path availability
#
# A successful response may contain a short-lived, one-time confirmation token.
float64 x
float64 y
float64 yaw_deg
float64 window
int32 goal_cost_limit
float64 plan_tolerance
bool strict_high_cost
---
# JSON result containing validation evidence and confirmation-token metadata.
std_msgs/String result_json
